    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kahelele ka kwīdumīla Ai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Yoshwa, “Ūtizogoha nūūlū ūtizūtawa tawa. Līsolage pyī ī libità lya bashilikale ūje ūkagūdumīle ū nzengo gwa Ai. Nguno nantūūlile mu nkono gwako ū ntemi wa Ai na a banhū bakwe, nū nzengo gwakwe, pyī nī sī yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nzengo gwa Ai nū ntemi wago ūkūgwītīla nago gīt'ūmo walī wagwītīlile nzengo gwa Yeliko nū ntemi wago. Gwike ī shisonzwa nī mitugo ja mu Ai, shose shenīsho mukūsola jibize sabo jing'we. Ū nzengo ūkūgwibandīīla kū numa yago.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Yoshwa ūbūūka nabo pye a bashilikale bakwe, būja kwīdumīla ī Ai. Ūsolaanhya banhū shihūmbī makūmi adatū ū mu bashilikale bakwe a babūdūla gete, ūbatūma būja ko makanza ga būjikū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbalagīja alībawīla, “Degelekagi chiza, mukūgwizīīla ū nzengo kūfuma kū numa yaago, hūna ng'wibande pye a bose mu masaka; alīyo yaya ū kūbiza kūle nago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū nene na a bashilikale abo nakūbiza nabo, tūkūgūdumīla ū nzengo kūfuma kū būtongi; a banhū baamo ūlū būtūbona bakūtwihuutīīla gīt'ūmo bakīītīla ī kwandya, nise tūkūbapeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakūtūpeeja batūkūūbīgije kūshisha tūbasegendeje ū kū nzengo, nguno bakwiwīla gīkī, ‘Baabo baatūpeela hangī gīt'ūmo bakīītīla kwandya.’ Na lūūlū ū ng'wikanza lya kū tūpeeja, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a bing'we mukūpuluka kūfuma aho ng'wibandaga mugūdime ū nzengo. Ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we akūgūtūūla mu makono ging'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ng'ūgūdima ū nzengo gwenūyo gūtiimagi moto. Ītagi gīt'ūmo SEEBA alagīlile, ū nene nang'winha ī shilagīlo; ning'we mukwīdīīlīīla lūūlū ī yīngī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yoshwa ūbaleka būja; nabo ng'hana būja ū kwipandī īlo lyigeleelilwe, būkibanda bbihī bbihī kwenūko, ha gatī ya Beeteli nī Ai. Alīyo ū wei ū Yoshwa ū būjikū wenūbo ūkeeyūla alī hamò na a banhū a bose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nzengo gwa Ai kūding'wa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kū ntondo dilū ū Yoshwa ūbūūka ūbahela chiza a bashilikale bakwe; ū wei na a batongeeji ba Baisilaeli būtongela ū kū būtongi aho bajile ī Ai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī libità ī lyoise īlo lyalī hamò nang'hwe būshimīza bajile ū kū nzengo, aho beegeela ū kū būtongi waago būtūūla ng'hambī kū lwande lwa sukuma ya Ai; a ha gatī yabo nū nzengo gūbiza ho ntubīlo gwa mbūga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yoshwa ūsola banhū gītī shihūmbī shitanò, ūbalagīla kwibanda ha gatī ya Beeteli na Ai, kū ng'weli ya nzengo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bashilikale a bose būhelwa chiza, būlī bene mu mapandī gabo; bamò baalī kū ng'hambī sukuma ya nzengo, na bangī bibanda kū ng'weli yaago ū nzengo, pye būmalīīla. Ū būjikū wenūbo ū Yoshwa ūja ūūkakeeyula kū ntubīlo gwa mbūga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Ai aho wabona gīko, ū wei na a banhū bakwe a bagosha ba mu nzengo gwenūyo būbūūka wangū wangū ītaalī dilū, būja kwamba būlūgū na a Baisilaeli kū ntulumenho gwa kūīlīīla kwitogolo lya Alaba. Alīyo walī atamanile ī gīkī baalīho banhū bang'wibandīīlile ū kū numa ya nzengo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoshwa na a Baisilaeli a bose būzunya ū kūpeejiwa balīshoshiwa kū numa; būpeela bajile kū nhogolo jaape. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagosha ba mu nzengo gwa Ai pye a bose bitanwa kūbakūūbya; būnkūūbya ū Yoshwa nī libità lya bashilikale bakwe, gashinaga balīdutwa kūsegenejiwa ū kū nzengo gwabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye gete a bagosha būfuma ū mu nzengo, atasaagile nūūlū ūmò ū mu mizengo ya Ai nī Beeteli, ū wa kūleka kūbapeeja a Baisilaeli. Būgūleka ng'waje ū nzengo būpeela kūbakūūbīja a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Yoshwa gīkī, “Līnunjage ng'wigūlya ī lichimu lyako īlo ūlībūūkije mu nkono gwako, ūlyolote kūlola Ai, nguno ū nzengo gwenūyo nakūgūtūūla mu nkono gwako.” Ng'hana ū Yoshwa ūlīnunja ng'wigūlya ī lichimu lyakwe kūlīloleja ī Ai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wīta dūhū ī gīko, a banhū abo baalī bibanda būpuluka wangū wangū; būpeela bajile ū kū nzengo, būkingīla mo būgūdima, hama būgūtiima moto ī likanza lyenīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba Ai aho bikībūka būlībona ī lyochi linunga kwigūlya kū malunde; alīyo būgayiwa ī lipandī ī lya kūpeelela kūlwa kwipīja, a Baisilaeli abo baabapeelaga kūīlīīla kwitogolo būbagalūkīla a bapeeja babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū Yoshwa na a Baisilaeli a bose abo wapeelaga nabo aho babona gīkī abo baalī bibanda bagūsola ū nzengo, nī lyochi līlīdundumūka kūfuma ū kū nzengo gwenūyo, bakabagalūkīla a bana Ai bandya kūbabūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bashilikale abo bakagūpemba moto ū nzengo nabo būbasanga; būbiza banyamanījiwa ha gatī; būlī lwandī būbiza ko Baisilaeli. A Baisilaeli bakababūlaga no, batalekeelile mpanga nūūlū ūmò, na atigelile wa kūpūlūgūka gīkī apeele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ntemi wa Ai ū ng'wene būndima alī mpanga gīko, būntwaala kūlī Yoshwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Banhū ba Ai kūmalwa pye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli aho bamala ū kūbabūlaga a bana Ai abo baalī kū malaale na kū matogolo ūko baalī babakūūbīja, aho bamalwa kūbūlaaagwa pye a bose, a Baisilaeli būshoka ū kū nzengo gwa Ai, būkababūlaga pye abo baalīmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lwenūlo būcha banhū shihūmbī igana na makūmi abīlī, bagosha na bakīma; pye a banhū ba mu nzengo gwa Ai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū Yoshwa atagwikije ū nkono gwakwe ūyo gwalī gwalīnunja ng'wigūlya ī lichimu, kūshisha būshila pye gete a bikaji ba mu nzengo gwa Ai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī chene a Baisilaeli bakasola mitugo na shikolo shingī, kūbiza shisonzwa shabo kūfuma ū mu nzengo gwenūyo, gīt'ūmo SEEBA walī wanagīīla ū Yoshwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Yoshwa ūgūpemba moto ū nzengo gwa Ai, ūgwīta kūbiza itūūgo lya būsoso ilalī, ipandī lītī lya kwikalīlwa na banhū kūshisha lelo īyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Ai ūnungeleja ha līntī kūshisha mhīndī; aho lyasalalīja ī līīmi, ū Yoshwa ūlagīja gwīnjiwa ū mimba gwenūyo ū mu līntī, gūponyiwa ha mita gwa kwingīlīla mu nzengo. Hūna būtūlīīla ho ilūndo itaale lya mawe, īlo nī lelo īyī lītaalī līlīho hoi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'walīlo mu lūgūlū lwa Ebaali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho, ū Yoshwa ūzenga ng'walīlo mu lūgūlū lwa Ebaali kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wa Baisilaeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gīt'ūmo Musa ntūmami o ng'wa SEEBA walī wabalagīīla a Baisilaeli. Akagūzenga kūlenganīla nū mumo handīkīlilwe ū mu shitabo sha shilagīlo sha ng'wa Musa, ng'walīlo gwa kūzengwa na mawe gatabeegelejilwe na munhū, ayo gatakuumiwe na shitūmamīlo sha chūūma shose shose. A higūlya yaago būmfunīja ū SEEBA shakwinha sha kūpemva; būfunya ho na shitambò sha būsangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho balī kwenūko, ū Yoshwa ūshandīka būpya ha mawe ī shilagīlo sha ng'wa Musa, īsho walī washandīka; ūshandīka a Baisilaeli balolile; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baisilaeli bose, bageni na a baana byalwa, hamò na a banamhala babo, na a bagunanhi na a balamuji babo; bose benaabo baalī ū kū mhandī būbīlī wajo ī j'isandīko lya ng'wa SEEBA ī lya būlagane, baalī bīmīīla būlolela ū kū banhū abo baalī balībūūkije, a bagabīji ba lūganda lwa Lawī. Nusu ya banhū baalī bīmīīla kū būtongi wa lūgūlū lwa Gelizimu, ī nusu ī yīngī kū būtongi wa lūgūlū lwa Ebaali, gīt'ūmo Musa ntūmami o ng'wa SEEBA walī wabalagīīlīla kūfuma kale, aho wabaganikīlaga mihayo ya kūbalombela a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū Yoshwa wīsoma pyī ī mihayo ya shilagīlo, ī na a mazumo, gīt'ūmo yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha Shilagīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu mihayo pyī īyo Musa walī walagīla, gūtasaagile nūūlū gūmò ūyo atagūsomile ū Yoshwa ū kū Baisilaeli bose abo baalī bibilinga, pye abo baalīho; a bakīma, baana, na a bageni abo bikalaga hamò nabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
